{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030170/extras/401465a39d51cd18297ea020e0ff49dd.poster.avif?t=1758572630\" width=720 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030170/extras/401465a39d51cd18297ea020e0ff49dd.webm?t=1758572630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smuggle Fruit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your criminal network by finding new contacts to smuggle fruit for you. Trade with or buy from them. Or grow and expand your own underground fruit farm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Together </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your underground sorbet shop solo or with a friend. Serve customers together, manage your supplies together and experience the story of Mango &amp; Berry together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030170/extras/0725294e405776fbda65d8b10a57d8d9.avif?t=1758572630\" width=1560 height=740 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evade &quot;Justice&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Queen of Henland's son went into a sugar coma from too many mangos, she's made all fruit illegal! Guards will search your front, sniffing around for fruit; illicit shipments will get confiscated and different fruits may become harder to get.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your shop with better stations and different buffs to enhance the customer experience. And decorate as you please!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030170/extras/0d6060c318e1c3552d83aa0d90449f6e.avif?t=1758572630\" width=750 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many useful and shady characters are very interested in profiting off your exploration. Smugglers have abandoned their dead drops for who knows why. Fruit and other useful items constantly wash ashore. A simple metal detector may be almost as profitable as an underground fruitery. Almost...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4030170?t=1758572630","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4030170?t=1758572630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030170/3032cbcfec3c58f54165ea1f2b9e8bda0bf88605/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758572630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030170/3032cbcfec3c58f54165ea1f2b9e8bda0bf88605/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758572630","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030170/extras/401465a39d51cd18297ea020e0ff49dd.poster.avif?t=1758572630\" width=720 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030170/extras/401465a39d51cd18297ea020e0ff49dd.webm?t=1758572630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smuggle Fruit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your criminal network by finding new contacts to smuggle fruit for you. Trade with or buy from them. Or grow and expand your own underground fruit farm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Together </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your underground sorbet shop solo or with a friend. Serve customers together, manage your supplies together and experience the story of Mango &amp; Berry together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030170/extras/0725294e405776fbda65d8b10a57d8d9.avif?t=1758572630\" width=1560 height=740 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evade &quot;Justice&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Queen of Henland's son went into a sugar coma from too many mangos, she's made all fruit illegal! Guards will search your front, sniffing around for fruit; illicit shipments will get confiscated and different fruits may become harder to get.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your shop with better stations and different buffs to enhance the customer experience. And decorate as you please!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030170/extras/0d6060c318e1c3552d83aa0d90449f6e.avif?t=1758572630\" width=750 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many useful and shady characters are very interested in profiting off your exploration. Smugglers have abandoned their dead drops for who knows why. Fruit and other useful items constantly wash ashore. A simple metal detector may be almost as profitable as an underground fruitery. Almost...</p>","developers":["Galaxy Bunny Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description